<div class="py-8"><h1 class="font-display text-2xl mb-2">Collection</h1><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">A reported state is only as fresh as its last collection run. The trigger is manual, so a pull request merged since the last run can still read as open here until the next one.</p><div class="data-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Approved records" tabindex="0"><table class="data-table"><caption class="sr-only">Approved records</caption><thead><tr><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Shortcode</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Project</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Approved</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Status</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col">Last reported</th><th class="data-table-head-cell" scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Actions</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0801</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-success badge-md">Published</span></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0802</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-info badge-md">Awaiting collection</span></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="italic text-neutral-600">Never reported on</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0803</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-info badge-md">Pull request open</span><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dasch-specs/pull/123" class="link " aria-label="View the pull request for 0803">View pull request</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0804</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-warning badge-md">Closed, will retry</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Needs no action — the next collection run reopens it.</p><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dasch-specs/pull/123" class="link " aria-label="View the pull request for 0804">View pull request</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0805</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-danger badge-md">Merged, still differs</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">The pull request merged, but the published data still differs from what was approved: reviewer edits landed instead of the depositor's own. Differs in: name, abstract.</p><p class="text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/dasch-swiss/dasch-specs/pull/123" class="link " aria-label="View the pull request for 0805">View pull request</a></p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><a href="/collection/5/discard" class="link " aria-label="Discard the approved record for 0805">Discard</a></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0806</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-danger badge-md">Collection failed</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Reason: GitHub API returned 500</p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0807</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-warning badge-md">Project dropped upstream</span></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0808</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="badge badge-danger badge-md">Payload unreadable</span><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Reason: invalid type: string, expected map</p></div></td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-02 09:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"></td></tr><tr><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="font-mono text-sm">0809</span></td><td class="data-table-cell">Bernoulli-Euler Online</td><td class="data-table-cell"><span class="text-sm">2026-09-01 08:00 UTC</span></td><td class="data-table-cell"><div class="flex flex-col g